#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An introduction to quantum machine learning (QML), data encoding, kernel "
"methods and variational quantum circuits."
msgstr ""
"Pengantar quantum machine learning (QML), pengkodean data, metode kernel, "
"dan variational quantum circuits."

