msgstr "Ujian {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To earn your badge for Quantum machine learning, take the exam at IBM&reg; "
"Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in "
"this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that "
"you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mendapatkan lencana Quantum machine learning, ikuti ujian di IBM&reg; "
"Training. Ujian ini dimaksudkan untuk diikuti setelah membaca pelajaran-"
"pelajaran dalam kursus ini. Setelah kamu lulus ujian, kamu akan diberitahu "
"oleh Credly bahwa kamu telah mendapatkan lencana.\n"

